mitigated. But D's crew cooperation concerns are high.\n\nGiven the criteria, I think C still seems best overall. So Emily can shift vote to Candidate C, acknowledging Sarah's suggestion to discuss A and D, but still recommending C for now, while we need to evaluate A and D.\n\nThus Emily's public message: acknowledge James and Sarah's points, note that C's strengths align with core criteria, but we need to examine A and D. She can say she now supports Candidate C, but wants to discuss A and D before final.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\". Ensure format.\n\nProceed."}
